# Files that are never served, kept out of the deployment. This is a scrape-surface and
# bandwidth measure: app/src alone is ~2.3MB of unminified source that nothing links to, and
# design-exports another 4.5MB.
#
# Safe only because this project has no build step on Vercel: index.html is built locally by
# build.mjs and committed. If a build command is ever added, app/, tools/ and build.mjs are its
# inputs and must come back off this list.
#
# Anything the running app fetches must stay OUT of this file: /sprites, /foods-uk.json,
# /manifest.webmanifest, /icon-*.png, /favicon.ico, /og.png, /sw.js, /web.
app/
tests/
tools/
design-exports/
design-plans/
.agents/
.claude/
.github/
supabase/
*.md
build.mjs
fix-og.mjs
gen-icons.mjs
skills-lock.json
